title "Incident response"
direction down

alert [bell]: Alert fires | SLO burn rate
ask real: actionable?
tune [muted bell-off]: Tune or silence the alert
ask sev: customer impact?
sev3 [ticket]: SEV-3 | fix in business hours
page [phone-call]: Page on-call | PagerDuty, 5 min ack
ask ack: acknowledged?
escalate [bad arrow-up-right]: Escalate | secondary, then manager
ic [siren]: Declare incident | commander, Slack channel
status [muted megaphone]: Status page | every 30 min
mitigate [wrench]: Mitigate | rollback, failover, flag
ask fixed: impact over?
review [ok document]: Postmortem | within 5 days, blameless

alert -> real
real -> tune [muted] : no
real -> sev : yes
sev -> sev3 : none
sev -> page : yes
page -> ack
ack -> escalate [bad] : no
escalate -> ic
ack -> ic : yes
ic -> status [muted dashed]
ic -> mitigate
mitigate -> fixed
mitigate <- fixed : no, next option
fixed -> review [ok] : yes
